{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:224","content":{"id":224,"title":"27 肺部免疫系统","content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c69099d1-f46f-4b37-abcd-6bc68bd6f24a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"人每次吸气量约 500ml，除了氧气外还有很多无用气体和各种微粒。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6c08a9b1-bb69-4377-91ed-c160d1560fec","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"细菌、病毒、真菌孢子可以吸附在空气的颗粒物、水蒸气或漂浮在空中。肺面临着大量有毒物质、颗粒和微生物的侵袭，如果免疫系统发生大规模反应，会造成组织损伤，这可不行。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ffa5f831-7caa-439b-8d71-ca007fca6ecc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"鼻腔是呼吸系统第一道防线，鼻毛可以阻挡较大的异物，呼吸系统也有黏液层，黏液会不停的排除体外或吞进肚子，在肺的最深处，仅有一层上皮细胞，是病原体的完美目标。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"0fab5862-fa5c-4abf-b8b2-501b39406d9d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这里有一种特殊的巨噬细胞，肺泡巨噬细胞，它会下调中性粒细胞等免疫细胞的敏感度，会缓和所有的炎症，肺部也有微生物组，但是我们很难对其采样，因此了解甚少。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"6a64e0d7-47c8-48fc-9e83-c1a99fce3cf5","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第三部分，恶意接管"},{"label":"27 肺部免疫系统","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:224","type":"doc","id":224}}],"prevPage":{"title":"26 病毒是什么","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:223","type":"doc","id":223}},"nextPage":{"title":"28 流感——威力被低估的病毒","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:231","type":"doc","id":231}},"createTime":1741656795013,"updateTime":1743303640526,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1743303640526}}